<title>SWITZERLAND: Immuno sees 1996 op profit steady to lower.</title>
<headline>Immuno sees 1996 op profit steady to lower.</headline>
<dateline>ZOLLIKON, Switzerland 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Immuno International AG said it expected its full-year 1996 operating profit to be steady or slightly lower than the 1995 level of 61 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>The blood products and vaccines company said financial results would depend on exchange rate developments, among other factors.</p>
<p>Baxter International Inc and Immuno said in August that Baxter intended to acquire the company over three years in a deal worth around 850 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom 41-1-258 7340</p>
